//@version=6
indicator('SMAs Ghost in the Machine v3 (Final)', shorttitle = 'SMA Ghosts v3', overlay = true)

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
//                      SMAs Ghost in the Machine v3.1
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Description:
// This script visualizes market trends across multiple timeframes by plotting 
// 9 and 20-period Simple Moving Averages (SMAs) on a single chart. It is 
// designed to identify moments of trend confluence, where short-term price 
// action aligns with, or reacts to, longer-term market flow. By projecting 
// higher timeframe SMAs ("Ghosts") onto the current chart, traders can gain a 
// deeper understanding of the underlying market structure.
//
// Created by: MercaderoAurum
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Key Features:
//
//  • Multi-Timeframe SMAs: Plots the 9/20 SMAs for the chart's current
//    timeframe and up to three additional, user-defined higher timeframes.
//
//  • Crossover Signals: Automatically plots shapes (triangles) and dynamic
//    text labels (e.g., "5min Death Cross") for 9/20 SMA crossovers on each
//    enabled timeframe.
//
//  • Granular Control: Every element can be customized. Each timeframe's SMA
//    lines and crossover signals can be toggled on or off independently from 
//    the indicator settings.
//
//  • Combined Signal: A highly configurable signal (diamond shape) that
//    triggers only when a specific combination of user-defined conditions
//    (price crosses, SMA crosses, etc.) occurs simultaneously.
//
//  • Comprehensive Alerts: Fully customizable alerts for individual SMA
//    crossovers and the powerful combined confluence signal.
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Strategy & Usage:
//
// The primary strategy is to trade in the direction of the higher timeframes
// while using the lower timeframes for precise entries. The higher timeframe
// SMAs act as your guide for the dominant trend.
//
//  • Bearish Confluence Example: Imagine you are on a 1-minute chart.
//    A downtrend might begin with a death cross on the 1-minute SMAs.
//    As the price action pushes down, you suddenly see a label appear that
//    says "5min Death Cross". This is a powerful confirmation signal. It
//    tells you that the medium-term momentum (the 5-min) is now aligned with
//    your short-term downtrend, suggesting a higher probability of continued
//    downside movement.
//
//  • Bullish Confluence Example: Conversely, if you see a "30min Gold Cross"
//    label appear while the 1-minute chart is already trending up, it can
//    signal a significant strengthening of the uptrend and provide a good
//    opportunity to enter or add to a long position.
//
//  • Dynamic Support & Resistance: Use the higher timeframe SMAs (e.g., the
//    30-min or 240-min lines) as dynamic levels of support and resistance.
//    A rejection of price from the 240-min 20 SMA on a 5-minute chart is
//    often a very significant event.
//
//  • Market Condition Filter: Avoid taking signals when the SMA lines are flat
//    and tangled together. This indicates a sideways, choppy market with no
//    clear trend, where crossover signals are unreliable.
//
//  • Build Your Own Setups: Use the 'Combined Crossover Signal' settings to
//    build your own high-conviction setups. For example, you could configure
//    a bullish signal to ONLY appear when a 1-minute Golden Cross happens
//    *while* the price is already above the 5-minute 20 SMA, effectively
//    filtering out weak counter-trend signals.
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Version History:
//
//   v3.1:
//   - Feature Update: Added dynamic on-chart text labels for crossover signals.
//   - Added granular controls to show/hide SMA lines and their corresponding
//     signals independently for each timeframe.
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

// == USER INPUTS ==
var styleGroup = "Style & Display Settings"
var currentTfGroup = "Current Timeframe Settings"
var tf1Group = "Timeframe 1 Settings"
var tf2Group = "Timeframe 2 Settings"
var tf3Group = "Timeframe 3 Settings"
var alertGroup = "Alert Settings"
var combinedSignalGroup = "Combined Crossover Signal"
var combinedBullishGroup = "--> Bullish Setup"
var combinedBearishGroup = "--> Bearish Setup"

show_crossover_labels = input.bool(true, title="Show Crossover Text Labels", group=styleGroup)
use_dark_mode_text = input.bool(true, title="Use White Text for Labels (Dark Mode)", group=styleGroup)


// --- Current Timeframe ---
use_current_tf = input.bool(true, title='Enable SMAs', group=currentTfGroup, inline="current")
show_current_tf_signals = input.bool(true, title="Show Crossover Signals", group=currentTfGroup, inline="current")

// --- Timeframe 1 ---
use_tf1 = input.bool(true, title='Enable SMAs', group=tf1Group, inline='TF1')
show_tf1_signals = input.bool(true, title="Show Crossover Signals", group=tf1Group, inline='TF1')
timeframe_1 = input.timeframe('5', title='Timeframe', group=tf1Group)

// --- Timeframe 2 ---
use_tf2 = input.bool(true, title='Enable SMAs', group=tf2Group, inline='TF2')
show_tf2_signals = input.bool(true, title="Show Crossover Signals", group=tf2Group, inline='TF2')
timeframe_2 = input.timeframe('30', title='Timeframe', group=tf2Group)

// --- Timeframe 3 ---
use_tf3 = input.bool(true, title='Enable SMAs', group=tf3Group, inline='TF3')
show_tf3_signals = input.bool(true, title="Show Crossover Signals", group=tf3Group, inline='TF3')
timeframe_3 = input.timeframe('240', title='Timeframe', group=tf3Group)

// --- Alert Settings ---
alert_current_tf_sma = input.bool(false, "Alert on Current TF Cross", group=alertGroup)
alert_tf1_sma = input.bool(false, "Alert on TF1 Cross", group=alertGroup)
alert_tf2_sma = input.bool(false, "Alert on TF2 Cross", group=alertGroup)
alert_tf3_sma = input.bool(false, "Alert on TF3 Cross", group=alertGroup)
alert_combined = input.bool(false, "Alert on Combined Signal", group=alertGroup)

// --- Combined Signal Settings ---
enable_combined_signal = input.bool(true, "Enable Combined Signal", group=combinedSignalGroup)
bull_current_price_9 = input.bool(true, "Current TF: Price crosses above 9 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_current_price_20 = input.bool(true, "Current TF: Price crosses above 20 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_current_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "Current TF: 9/20 Golden Cross", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf1_price_9 = input.bool(true, "TF1: Price crosses above 9 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf1_price_20 = input.bool(false, "TF1: Price crosses above 20 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf1_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "TF1: 9/20 Golden Cross", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf2_price_9 = input.bool(false, "TF2: Price crosses above 9 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf2_price_20 = input.bool(false, "TF2: Price crosses above 20 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf2_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "TF2: 9/20 Golden Cross", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf3_price_9 = input.bool(false, "TF3: Price crosses above 9 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf3_price_20 = input.bool(false, "TF3: Price crosses above 20 SMA", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bull_tf3_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "TF3: 9/20 Golden Cross", group=combinedBullishGroup)
bear_current_price_9 = input.bool(true, "Current TF: Price crosses below 9 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_current_price_20 = input.bool(true, "Current TF: Price crosses below 20 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_current_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "Current TF: 9/20 Death Cross", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf1_price_9 = input.bool(true, "TF1: Price crosses below 9 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf1_price_20 = input.bool(false, "TF1: Price crosses below 20 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf1_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "TF1: 9/20 Death Cross", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf2_price_9 = input.bool(false, "TF2: Price crosses below 9 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf2_price_20 = input.bool(false, "TF2: Price crosses below 20 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf2_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "TF2: 9/20 Death Cross", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf3_price_9 = input.bool(false, "TF3: Price crosses below 9 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf3_price_20 = input.bool(false, "TF3: Price crosses below 20 SMA", group=combinedBearishGroup)
bear_tf3_sma_cross = input.bool(false, "TF3: 9/20 Death Cross", group=combinedBearishGroup)

// == SMA CALCULATIONS ==
SMA_9_current = use_current_tf ? ta.sma(close, 9) : na
SMA_20_current = use_current_tf ? ta.sma(close, 20) : na
SMA_9_tf1 = use_tf1 ? request.security(syminfo.tickerid, timeframe_1, ta.sma(close, 9), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on) : na
SMA_20_tf1 = use_tf1 ? request.security(syminfo.tickerid, timeframe_1, ta.sma(close, 20), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on) : na
SMA_9_tf2 = use_tf2 ? request.security(syminfo.tickerid, timeframe_2, ta.sma(close, 9), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on) : na
SMA_20_tf2 = use_tf2 ? request.security(syminfo.tickerid, timeframe_2, ta.sma(close, 20), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on) : na
SMA_9_tf3 = use_tf3 ? request.security(syminfo.tickerid, timeframe_3, ta.sma(close, 9), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on) : na
SMA_20_tf3 = use_tf3 ? request.security(syminfo.tickerid, timeframe_3, ta.sma(close, 20), lookahead=barmerge.lookahead_on) : na

// == PLOT SMA LINES ==
plot(SMA_9_current, title='9 SMA (Current TF)', color=color.new(color.yellow, 0), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_20_current, title='20 SMA (Current TF)', color=color.new(color.white, 0), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_9_tf1, title='9 SMA (TF1)', color=color.new(color.green, 0), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_20_tf1, title='20 SMA (TF1)', color=color.new(color.red, 0), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_9_tf2, title='9 SMA (TF2)', color=color.new(color.blue, 50), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_20_tf2, title='20 SMA (TF2)', color=color.new(color.orange, 50), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_9_tf3, title='9 SMA (TF3)', color=color.new(color.purple, 50), linewidth=1)
plot(SMA_20_tf3, title='20 SMA (TF3)', color=color.new(color.teal, 50), linewidth=1)

// == CROSSOVER CONDITIONS ==
current_tf_golden_cross = use_current_tf and show_current_tf_signals and ta.crossover(SMA_9_current, SMA_20_current)
current_tf_death_cross = use_current_tf and show_current_tf_signals and ta.crossunder(SMA_9_current, SMA_20_current)
tf1_golden_cross = use_tf1 and show_tf1_signals and ta.crossover(SMA_9_tf1, SMA_20_tf1)
tf1_death_cross = use_tf1 and show_tf1_signals and ta.crossunder(SMA_9_tf1, SMA_20_tf1)
tf2_golden_cross = use_tf2 and show_tf2_signals and ta.crossover(SMA_9_tf2, SMA_20_tf2)
tf2_death_cross = use_tf2 and show_tf2_signals and ta.crossunder(SMA_9_tf2, SMA_20_tf2)
tf3_golden_cross = use_tf3 and show_tf3_signals and ta.crossover(SMA_9_tf3, SMA_20_tf3)
tf3_death_cross = use_tf3 and show_tf3_signals and ta.crossunder(SMA_9_tf3, SMA_20_tf3)

// == COMBINED SIGNAL LOGIC ==
price_crossover_9_current = use_current_tf and ta.crossover(close, SMA_9_current)
price_crossunder_9_current = use_current_tf and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_9_current)
price_crossover_20_current = use_current_tf and ta.crossover(close, SMA_20_current)
price_crossunder_20_current = use_current_tf and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_20_current)
price_crossover_9_tf1 = use_tf1 and ta.crossover(close, SMA_9_tf1)
price_crossunder_9_tf1 = use_tf1 and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_9_tf1)
price_crossover_20_tf1 = use_tf1 and ta.crossover(close, SMA_20_tf1)
price_crossunder_20_tf1 = use_tf1 and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_20_tf1)
price_crossover_9_tf2 = use_tf2 and ta.crossover(close, SMA_9_tf2)
price_crossunder_9_tf2 = use_tf2 and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_9_tf2)
price_crossover_20_tf2 = use_tf2 and ta.crossover(close, SMA_20_tf2)
price_crossunder_20_tf2 = use_tf2 and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_20_tf2)
price_crossover_9_tf3 = use_tf3 and ta.crossover(close, SMA_9_tf3)
price_crossunder_9_tf3 = use_tf3 and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_9_tf3)
price_crossover_20_tf3 = use_tf3 and ta.crossover(close, SMA_20_tf3)
price_crossunder_20_tf3 = use_tf3 and ta.crossunder(close, SMA_20_tf3)
any_bull_condition_selected = bull_current_price_9 or bull_current_price_20 or bull_current_sma_cross or bull_tf1_price_9 or bull_tf1_price_20 or bull_tf1_sma_cross or bull_tf2_price_9 or bull_tf2_price_20 or bull_tf2_sma_cross or bull_tf3_price_9 or bull_tf3_price_20 or bull_tf3_sma_cross
any_bear_condition_selected = bear_current_price_9 or bear_current_price_20 or bear_current_sma_cross or bear_tf1_price_9 or bear_tf1_price_20 or bear_tf1_sma_cross or bear_tf2_price_9 or bear_tf2_price_20 or bear_tf2_sma_cross or bear_tf3_price_9 or bear_tf3_price_20 or bear_tf3_sma_cross
bullish_signal = enable_combined_signal and any_bull_condition_selected and (bull_current_price_9 ? price_crossover_9_current : true) and (bull_current_price_20 ? price_crossover_20_current : true) and (bull_current_sma_cross ? current_tf_golden_cross : true) and (bull_tf1_price_9 ? price_crossover_9_tf1 : true) and (bull_tf1_price_20 ? price_crossover_20_tf1 : true) and (bull_tf1_sma_cross ? tf1_golden_cross : true) and (bull_tf2_price_9 ? price_crossover_9_tf2 : true) and (bull_tf2_price_20 ? price_crossover_20_tf2 : true) and (bull_tf2_sma_cross ? tf2_golden_cross : true) and (bull_tf3_price_9 ? price_crossover_9_tf3 : true) and (bull_tf3_price_20 ? price_crossover_20_tf3 : true) and (bull_tf3_sma_cross ? tf3_golden_cross : true)
bearish_signal = enable_combined_signal and any_bear_condition_selected and (bear_current_price_9 ? price_crossunder_9_current : true) and (bear_current_price_20 ? price_crossunder_20_current : true) and (bear_current_sma_cross ? current_tf_death_cross : true) and (bear_tf1_price_9 ? price_crossunder_9_tf1 : true) and (bear_tf1_price_20 ? price_crossunder_20_tf1 : true) and (bear_tf1_sma_cross ? tf1_death_cross : true) and (bear_tf2_price_9 ? price_crossunder_9_tf2 : true) and (bear_tf2_price_20 ? price_crossunder_20_tf2 : true) and (bear_tf2_sma_cross ? tf2_death_cross : true) and (bear_tf3_price_9 ? price_crossunder_9_tf3 : true) and (bear_tf3_price_20 ? price_crossunder_20_tf3 : true) and (bear_tf3_sma_cross ? tf3_death_cross : true)

// == PLOT SHAPES (No text) ==
plotshape(current_tf_golden_cross, title='Current TF Golden Cross', style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(#0307f3, 0), size=size.small)
plotshape(current_tf_death_cross, title='Current TF Death Cross', style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.white, 25), size=size.small)
plotshape(tf1_golden_cross, title='TF1 Golden Cross', style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(#f3f306, 0), size=size.small)
plotshape(tf1_death_cross, title='TF1 Death Cross', style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 25), size=size.small)
plotshape(tf2_golden_cross, title='TF2 Golden Cross', style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(#1f7101, 21), size=size.small)
plotshape(tf2_death_cross, title='TF2 Death Cross', style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(#fdb500, 8), size=size.small)
plotshape(tf3_golden_cross, title='TF3 Golden Cross', style=shape.triangleup, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.green, 25), size=size.small)
plotshape(tf3_death_cross, title='TF3 Death Cross', style=shape.triangledown, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 25), size=size.small)
plotshape(bullish_signal, title='Combined Bullish Signal', text='C Bull', style=shape.diamond, location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.green, 0), textcolor=color.new(color.white, 0), size=size.normal)
plotshape(bearish_signal, title='Combined Bearish Signal', text='C Bear', style=shape.diamond, location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 0), textcolor=color.new(color.white, 0), size=size.normal)

// == PLOT DYNAMIC LABELS ==
// Determine the universal text color based on the user's selection
color label_text_color = use_dark_mode_text ? color.white : color.black

if show_crossover_labels
    if current_tf_golden_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe.period + " Gold Cross", yloc=yloc.belowbar, style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(color.yellow, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if current_tf_death_cross
        // THIS IS THE CORRECTED LINE: Gray background works with both black and white text.
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe.period + " Death Cross", yloc=yloc.abovebar, style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(color.gray, 50), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if tf1_golden_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe_1 + " Gold Cross", yloc=yloc.belowbar, style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(color.green, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if tf1_death_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe_1 + " Death Cross", yloc=yloc.abovebar, style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(color.red, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if tf2_golden_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe_2 + " Gold Cross", yloc=yloc.belowbar, style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(color.green, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if tf2_death_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe_2 + " Death Cross", yloc=yloc.abovebar, style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(color.red, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if tf3_golden_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe_3 + " Gold Cross", yloc=yloc.belowbar, style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(color.green, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)
    if tf3_death_cross
        label.new(bar_index, na, text=timeframe_3 + " Death Cross", yloc=yloc.abovebar, style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(color.red, 75), textcolor=label_text_color)

// == ALERTS ==
var string combined_bull_msg = ""
if bullish_signal
    combined_bull_msg := "Combined Bullish Signal:\n"
    if bull_current_price_9
        combined_bull_msg += "• Current TF: Price > 9 SMA\n"
    if bull_current_price_20
        combined_bull_msg += "• Current TF: Price > 20 SMA\n"
    if bull_current_sma_cross
        combined_bull_msg += "• Current TF: 9/20 Golden Cross\n"
    if bull_tf1_price_9
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF1 (" + timeframe_1 + "): Price > 9 SMA\n"
    if bull_tf1_price_20
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF1 (" + timeframe_1 + "): Price > 20 SMA\n"
    if bull_tf1_sma_cross
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF1 (" + timeframe_1 + "): 9/20 Golden Cross\n"
    if bull_tf2_price_9
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF2 (" + timeframe_2 + "): Price > 9 SMA\n"
    if bull_tf2_price_20
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF2 (" + timeframe_2 + "): Price > 20 SMA\n"
    if bull_tf2_sma_cross
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF2 (" + timeframe_2 + "): 9/20 Golden Cross\n"
    if bull_tf3_price_9
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF3 (" + timeframe_3 + "): Price > 9 SMA\n"
    if bull_tf3_price_20
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF3 (" + timeframe_3 + "): Price > 20 SMA\n"
    if bull_tf3_sma_cross
        combined_bull_msg += "• TF3 (" + timeframe_3 + "): 9/20 Golden Cross\n"

var string combined_bear_msg = ""
if bearish_signal
    combined_bear_msg := "Combined Bearish Signal:\n"
    if bear_current_price_9
        combined_bear_msg += "• Current TF: Price < 9 SMA\n"
    if bear_current_price_20
        combined_bear_msg += "• Current TF: Price < 20 SMA\n"
    if bear_current_sma_cross
        combined_bear_msg += "• Current TF: 9/20 Death Cross\n"
    if bear_tf1_price_9
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF1 (" + timeframe_1 + "): Price < 9 SMA\n"
    if bear_tf1_price_20
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF1 (" + timeframe_1 + "): Price < 20 SMA\n"
    if bear_tf1_sma_cross
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF1 (" + timeframe_1 + "): 9/20 Death Cross\n"
    if bear_tf2_price_9
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF2 (" + timeframe_2 + "): Price < 9 SMA\n"
    if bear_tf2_price_20
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF2 (" + timeframe_2 + "): Price < 20 SMA\n"
    if bear_tf2_sma_cross
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF2 (" + timeframe_2 + "): 9/20 Death Cross\n"
    if bear_tf3_price_9
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF3 (" + timeframe_3 + "): Price < 9 SMA\n"
    if bear_tf3_price_20
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF3 (" + timeframe_3 + "): Price < 20 SMA\n"
    if bear_tf3_sma_cross
        combined_bear_msg += "• TF3 (" + timeframe_3 + "): 9/20 Death Cross\n"

if alert_current_tf_sma and current_tf_golden_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe.period + " Gold Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_current_tf_sma and current_tf_death_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe.period + " Death Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_tf1_sma and tf1_golden_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe_1 + " Gold Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_tf1_sma and tf1_death_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe_1 + " Death Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_tf2_sma and tf2_golden_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe_2 + " Gold Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_tf2_sma and tf2_death_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe_2 + " Death Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_tf3_sma and tf3_golden_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe_3 + " Gold Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_tf3_sma and tf3_death_cross
    alert(syminfo.ticker + ": " + timeframe_3 + " Death Cross", alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_combined and bullish_signal
    alert(syminfo.ticker + " - " + combined_bull_msg, alert.freq_once_per_bar)
if alert_combined and bearish_signal
    alert(syminfo.ticker + " - " + combined_bear_msg, alert.freq_once_per_bar)
